            "value": "إضافة نص"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Anyone opening the document will be asked for it. There is no way to recover a forgotten password.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "سيُطلب من كل من يفتح المستند. لا سبيل لاستعادة كلمة مرور منسية."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Appearance": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "المظهر"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply the rules now": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تطبيق القواعد الآن"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply to every page": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تطبيق على كل الصفحات"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arabic and English read on the device itself": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "العربية والإنجليزية تُقرآن على الجهاز نفسه"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arabic is not among the languages this device's text recognition supports.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "العربية ليست من اللغات التي يدعمها التعرّف على النصوص في هذا الجهاز."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Arabic is not among the languages this device's text recognition supports; scans of Arabic pages get no searchable text here. The languages listed are the device's own answer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
