            "state": "translated",
            "value": "إلى"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too few lines of text were found to measure the page's curve; it is left as it is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "عُثر على سطور أقل من أن يُقاس بها انحناء الصفحة؛ تُركت كما هي."
          }
